WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.034
JOHN DEAN: Gentlemen,
the President needs

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.102
men of action.

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:04.837
Your new mission
is to make sure

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:06.506
he wins this election.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.042
What are we talking about here?

00:00:10.242 --> 00:00:12.444
JOHN:
 Sabotage, espionage.

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:15.314
 Infiltration,
 bare-knuckle tactics.

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:17.116
 Same shit they do to us
 every election.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.185
SPEAKER: We have recruited
 covert operatives

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:21.788
to plant surveillance inside
 the Watergate.

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:24.457
KROGH: You are White House
employees on the payroll.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.692
For God's sake,
don't get caught.

00:00:26.825 --> 00:00:28.594
(LAUGHS)

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.597
♪ ("EVIL WAYS"
BY SANTANA PLAYS) ♪

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.203
E. HOWARD HUNT:
 We'll be laughed at
as third-rate burglars forever.

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:39.805
-(CAMERA SHUTTER SNAP)
-REPORTERS: Mr. Hunt!

00:00:40.139 --> 00:00:43.042
People need to understand
why we did what we did.

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:44.643
Sometimes,
I find it confusing.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.145
♪ (MUSIC STOPS) ♪

00:00:46.512 --> 00:00:47.513
And we did it.

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:49.549
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:56.889
(SIRENS WAIL)

00:00:56.989 --> 00:00:58.858
Why is the FBI here?

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:01.127
Howard, we are well
and truly fucked!

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:03.229
HOWARD:
 They should fear me.

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:07.066
I know things that could tear
this country apart.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.135
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:11.570
♪ (MUSIC STOPS) ♪

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:14.741
Who really killed JFK?

00:01:16.008 --> 00:01:17.109
Oh, Christ.

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:19.479
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

